<title>PHILIPPINES: Bankers Association of the Philippines announcement.</title>
<headline>Bankers Association of the Philippines announcement.</headline>
<text>
<p>The following announcement is from the Bankers Association of the Philippines.</p>
<p>Banks in PHIBOR fixing are reminded to narrow their spreads down to a maximum of two percent as previously agreed upon.</p>
<p>- manila.newsroom&amp;reuters.com</p>
<p>- Tel - (632) 841-8937 fax 8176267</p>
